### Food-list scaling (`js/stapleServingPrintout.js`)

```
displayed grams = stapleCategoryServings(planServings, category) × base one-serving weight
```

| Food-list section | Multiplier |
|-------------------|------------|
| Protein + dairy | `planServings.protein / 3` |
| Grains & starches | `planServings.grainsStarches / 3` |
| Vegetables | `planServings.vegetables` (daily) |
| Fruit | `planServings.fruits / 3` |
| Extra fat / sugar / alcohol | Not on staple pages |

Payload: `payload.servings.planServings` from `js/programReportPrintout.js`.

